# Static files: staticfiles/ is BUILD OUTPUT — the server rebuilds it via
# collectstatic in .platform/hooks + .platform/confighooks. Shipping a stale
# local copy masks collectstatic ("N unmodified") and leaves production with
# un-postprocessed files and no manifest (July 2026 broken-admin incident).
# static/ (the sources) stays in the bundle.
staticfiles/

# Media files (should be handled separately)
media/ 

